        "TileImage": "$($repository 6d110ab1-d238-4309-b5b9-c51070c7e0d3).Image",
        "Description": "Sneak into this heavily fortified facility and take out the most innocent people on the job site. These guys get up every morning an go to work. Doesn&apos;t that make your left wing liberal brain just go crazy? Work? We demand food stamps and free clothes! Teach these non-liberal hippie occultists what it means to live in a big city and come from rich parents and still live off the government for free! These men are clearly endangering the welfare state.",
